@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Oil &amp; Gas Foundry Agents</h1>

<p>
    This Aspire demo provisions an Azure AI Foundry project, deploys a shared chat model,
    and publishes three Microsoft Agent Framework hosted agents for oil and gas workflows.
</p>

<FluentCard Style="max-width: 900px;">
    <h2>Demo flow</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Start the AppHost and open the Aspire dashboard.</li>
        <li>Inspect the Foundry project, model deployment, hosted agents, health checks, logs, and traces.</li>
        <li>Use each hosted agent resource's <strong>Send Message</strong> command to invoke the Foundry Responses endpoint.</li>
    </ol>
</FluentCard>
